== Trivia ==
* The item is a reference to the show ''[[wikipedia:My Little Pony: Friendship Is Magic|My Little Pony: Friendship is Magic]]''. The unicorn is one of the three types of ponies in the show, the others being the pegasus and the earth pony. A notable unicorn from the show is Twilight Sparkle, its main character.
* In the original ''Binding Of Isaac'', using the item changed the music instead of speeding it up.
* If you pause the game while under the effect of My Little Unicorn, the music plays indefinitely.

